---
/**
 * Seed deck — Global Corporate Venture Capital for Multinational Market Leaders.
 * Adapted from hypernova-site to use FullStack VC's OneSlideDeck and theme tokens.
 */
import OneSlideDeck from '../../layouts/OneSlideDeck.astro';

export const presentation = {
  title: 'Global Corporate Venture Capital for Multinational Market Leaders',
  description: 'Strategic Investment Models, Pipeline Management, and Innovation Ecosystem Engagement',
  author: 'Michael Staton',
  date: '2025-01-01',
  tags: ['CVC', 'venture-capital', 'corporate-strategy', 'innovation'],
};
---

<OneSlideDeck title={presentation.title} description={presentation.description}>
  <section class="title-slide">
    <p class="eyebrow">Hypernova · 2025</p>
    <h1 class="gradient-headline">Global Corporate<br/>Venture Capital</h1>
    <h2>for Multinational Market Leaders</h2>
    <p><em>Strategic Investment Models, Pipeline Management, and Innovation Ecosystem Engagement</em></p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Executive Summary</h2>
    <p>Corporate Venture Capital has evolved from <strong>experimental initiatives</strong> to sophisticated strategic capabilities that drive competitive advantage for global multinationals.</p>
    <ul>
      <li class="fragment">🏢 <strong>50%</strong> of Fortune 100 companies now have established CVC programs</li>
      <li class="fragment">🌍 Geographic diversification essential for innovation access</li>
      <li class="fragment">🤝 Integration capabilities distinguish successful programs</li>
      <li class="fragment">📈 22% use secondary markets for portfolio liquidity</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <section>
      <h2>The Evolution of Corporate VC</h2>
      <h3>From Peripheral to Strategic Core</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">🔄 <strong>Transformation</strong> — From risk-averse to competitive necessity</li>
        <li class="fragment">⚡ <strong>Speed &amp; Independence</strong> — Balancing corporate resources with startup agility</li>
        <li class="fragment">🌐 <strong>Global Distribution</strong> — Innovation no longer concentrated in traditional hubs</li>
        <li class="fragment">🎯 <strong>Strategic Alignment</strong> — Clear mandates and governance structures</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Modern CVC Characteristics</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">Stage-agnostic investment criteria (seed to Series D)</li>
        <li class="fragment">Independent investment committees and compensation</li>
        <li class="fragment">Structured integration pathways and innovation councils</li>
        <li class="fragment">Professional venture capital management practices</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section>
    <section>
      <h2>Strategic Investment Models</h2>
      <h3>Diverse Approaches by Global Leaders</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">💰 <strong>Direct CVC Funds</strong> — Company-managed investment vehicles</li>
        <li class="fragment">🤝 <strong>Fund-of-Funds</strong> — Leveraging specialized VC expertise</li>
        <li class="fragment">🎯 <strong>Strategic Minorities</strong> — Targeted operational synergies</li>
        <li class="fragment">🌐 <strong>Collaborative Models</strong> — Multi-partner investment structures</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Case Study: Nestlé's Multi-Vehicle Approach</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">Fund-of-funds strategy with proven VC partners</li>
        <li class="fragment">Nestlé Health Science as operating division + investment platform</li>
        <li class="fragment">Panela House São Paulo — 70+ startups, 1,800 companies engaged</li>
        <li class="fragment">Focus on regenerative food ecosystems and ESG</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section>
    <section>
      <h2>Pipeline Management &amp; Market Intelligence</h2>
      <h3>Systematic Opportunity Identification</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">🔍 <strong>Multi-Touchpoint Systems</strong> — Comprehensive market monitoring</li>
        <li class="fragment">🤖 <strong>AI-Powered Analytics</strong> — Patent, research, and trend analysis</li>
        <li class="fragment">🌐 <strong>Global Relationship Networks</strong> — VCs, accelerators, universities</li>
        <li class="fragment">📊 <strong>Multidimensional Evaluation</strong> — Strategic, financial, technical, regulatory</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Unilever's Innovation Ecosystem</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">400+ pilots launched, 170+ startup investments</li>
        <li class="fragment">Food Open Innovation Hub in Wageningen</li>
        <li class="fragment">Real-world research + real-time consumer feedback</li>
        <li class="fragment">Sustainability integration across innovation pipeline</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section>
    <section>
      <h2>Integration &amp; Value Creation</h2>
      <h3>Beyond Financial Returns</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">🔄 <strong>Operational Synergies</strong> — Technology integration into existing products</li>
        <li class="fragment">🎯 <strong>Market Access</strong> — Distribution and customer relationships</li>
        <li class="fragment">🧠 <strong>Knowledge Transfer</strong> — Learning and capability development</li>
        <li class="fragment">⚖️ <strong>Balanced Autonomy</strong> — Corporate resources without stifling innovation</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h3>Microsoft M12: Ecosystem Development</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="fragment">Strategic investments complementing core business areas</li>
        <li class="fragment">Access to Microsoft's vast ecosystem and expertise</li>
        <li class="fragment">Network effects and platform enhancement value</li>
        <li class="fragment">Competitive advantage through ecosystem strength</li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Current Market Dynamics</h2>
    <div class="two-col">
      <div>
        <h3>Investment Focus Areas</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>🤖 Artificial Intelligence</li>
          <li>🌱 Sustainability Technologies</li>
          <li>🏥 Health &amp; Wellness</li>
          <li>🔗 Supply Chain Innovation</li>
          <li>📱 Digital Transformation</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Market Trends</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>22% using secondary markets</li>
          <li>Increasing global diversification</li>
          <li>ESG integration requirements</li>
          <li>Faster decision-making processes</li>
          <li>Professional management adoption</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>CVC Implementation Framework</h2>
    <div class="three-col">
      <div>
        <h3>Foundation</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Strategic mandate definition</li>
          <li>Governance structure setup</li>
          <li>Initial fund establishment</li>
          <li>Team recruitment &amp; training</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Expansion</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Global market entry</li>
          <li>Portfolio diversification</li>
          <li>Integration mechanisms</li>
          <li>Partnership networks</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Maturation</h3>
        <ul>
          <li>Ecosystem leadership</li>
          <li>Advanced analytics integration</li>
          <li>Secondary market utilization</li>
          <li>Cross-portfolio synergies</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Strategic Imperative</h2>
    <p>CVC has become <strong>essential infrastructure</strong> for multinationals seeking competitive advantage in rapidly evolving markets.</p>
    <ul>
      <li class="fragment">🚀 Innovation access via global startup ecosystems</li>
      <li class="fragment">🎯 Early identification of trends and disruptions</li>
      <li class="fragment">🔄 Translation of external innovation into competitive advantage</li>
      <li class="fragment">🌍 Positioning for next-generation market transformation</li>
    </ul>
    <blockquote class="fragment">
      The most successful multinationals will be those that build CVC as an effective bridge between external innovation and internal strategic execution.
    </blockquote>
  </section>
</OneSlideDeck>

<style is:global>
  .reveal .two-col,
  .reveal .three-col {
    display: grid;
    gap: 2rem;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 70rem;
    margin: 1rem auto 0;
  }
  .reveal .two-col   { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
